# r1113 chunk 1, old-save pair for SQ-GLD-16, boot 1 of 2 (c1_g2.qb is boot 2): makes the old world. Group A superflat,
# level c1g. INSTALLED jars only: the CD jar in mods/ (11-10 21:20) still registers the six golden and gilded stews
# and their cans and jar fluids (it ships soft_fluids/golden_mushroom_stew.json; its swaps/removed.json has no stew);
# the build/libs CD (11-11 16:52) has them removed.
# Setup before boot (server stopped):
#   NOSWAP=1 bash $INST/tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT c1g A spawn-animals=false
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zp_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zp_probe.js     # /zp inv
#   ls OUT/srv/mods | grep creativedelight      (must be creativedelight-1.1.0.jar hard-linked from mods/, 11-10)
# After this batch: stop the server (save-all is the last command), then before boot 2:
#   bash $INST/tools/scratch_query/oldsave_swap.sh OUT        (Creative jars -> newest build/libs copies; same level)
# No config edits. Work spot: chest 2000 -60 2000, jar 2003 -60 2000, bot c1gj (keeps two stews in its inventory).
pace 1

